ing behavior.   In case of emergency, nearby devices will be alerted immediately and a signal will be sent to our central server, which will send the location of the accident to the nearest emergency centers. This will also act as a base for smart traffic management system.","topics":[],"score":151987,"global_rank":454138},{"name":"ryancox/hiatus","owner":"ryancox","html_url":"https://github.com/ryancox/hiatus","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":151987,"global_rank":454139},{"name":"vritant24/ProsePro","owner":"vritant24","html_url":"https://github.com/vritant24/ProsePro","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"A Word Processor for Professional and Hobbyist writer, with inbuilt version control functionality","topics":[],"score":151987,"global_rank":454140},{"name":"jawang94/python_lyric_masher","owner":"jawang94","html_url":"https://github.com/jawang94/python_lyric_masher","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"fetches and mashes lyrics from your favorite artists","topics":[],"score":151987,"global_rank":454141},{"name":"daniellmb/ama","owner":"daniellmb","html_url":"https://github.com/daniellmb/ama","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Ask me anything!","topics":[],"score":151982,"global_rank":454142},{"name":"rococode/twitter-follow","owner":"rococode","html_url":"https://github.com/rococode/twitter-follow","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"wip","topics":[],"score":151980,"global_rank":454143},{"name":"DavidRS91/tic-tac-toe","owner":"DavidRS91","html_url":"https://github.com/DavidRS91/tic-tac-toe","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Learning about golang and microservices architecture by way of building a tic-tac-toe webapp","topics":[],"score":151980,"global_rank":454144},{"name":"laurens914/iOSWe